### `membership_status`

`active` | `expiring_soon` | `expired`

### `resource_type`

`room` | `equipment`

### `booking_status`

`pending` | `approved` | `rejected` | `cancelled`

### `donation_type`

`one_off` | `recurring_pledge`

### `notification_type`

`booking` | `membership` | `donation` | `system`

## RLS Policies

### `resources`

| Policy                                | Command | Roles               | Action     | USING                 | WITH CHECK            |
| ------------------------------------- | ------- | ------------------- | ---------- | --------------------- | --------------------- |
| `Anyone can view available resources` | SELECT  | anon, authenticated | PERMISSIVE | `(available = true)`  | —                     |
| `Staff can manage resources`          | ALL     | authenticated       | PERMISSIVE | `is_staff_or_admin()` | `is_staff_or_admin()` |

### `profiles`

| Policy                         | Command | Roles         | Action     | USING                                        | WITH CHECK            |
| ------------------------------ | ------- | ------------- | ---------- | -------------------------------------------- | --------------------- |
| `Staff can update profiles`    | UPDATE  | authenticated | PERMISSIVE | `is_staff_or_admin()`                        | `is_staff_or_admin()` |
| `Users can update own profile` | UPDATE  | authenticated | PERMISSIVE | `(id = auth.uid())`                          | `(id = auth.uid())`   |
| `Users can view own profile`   | SELECT  | authenticated | PERMISSIVE | `((id = auth.uid()) OR is_staff_or_admin())` | —                     |

### `bookings`

| Policy                            | Command | Roles         | Action     | USING                                               | WITH CHECK                 |
| --------------------------------- | ------- | ------------- | ---------- | --------------------------------------------------- | -------------------------- |
| `Members can create own bookings` | INSERT  | authenticated | PERMISSIVE | —                                                   | `(member_id = auth.uid())` |
| `Members can update own bookings` | UPDATE  | authenticated | PERMISSIVE | `(member_id = auth.uid())`                          | `(member_id = auth.uid())` |
| `Members can view own bookings`   | SELECT  | authenticated | PERMISSIVE | `((member_id = auth.uid()) OR is_staff_or_admin())` | —                          |
| `Staff can manage bookings`       | ALL     | authenticated | PERMISSIVE | `is_staff_or_admin()`                               | `is_staff_or_admin()`      |

